{"4426690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Checkpoint 19", "steam_appid": 4426690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Checkpoint 19 is a border control management game where speed keeps traffic moving, but every shortcut increases the chance of letting criminals through.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage a growing checkpoint facility. Inspect vehicles, assign officers, expand lanes, control traffic flow, and decide how much risk you are willing to accept.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Decision Trades Speed for Security</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process vehicles quickly and queues stay under control.<br>Inspect too lightly and contraband slips through.<br>Inspect too strictly and traffic turns into gridlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is not to eliminate risk.<br>Your job is to survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5de3c9617e705d7bb64d6c6e3f60fb11.poster.avif?t=1785535994\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5de3c9617e705d7bb64d6c6e3f60fb11.webm?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5de3c9617e705d7bb64d6c6e3f60fb11.mp4?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Officers Under Pressure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire officers with different strengths. Assign them to checkpoints, secondary inspections, and support roles. But staff are not machines. Fatigue, workload, and poor assignments increase mistakes when the pressure rises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/aff45920c4eb9d6f4a8f55f42d5b681c.poster.avif?t=1785535994\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/aff45920c4eb9d6f4a8f55f42d5b681c.webm?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/aff45920c4eb9d6f4a8f55f42d5b681c.mp4?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Checkpoint That Can Survive Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand roads, inspection lanes, surveillance zones, holding areas, and logistics routes. A layout that works during calm traffic may collapse when volume increases or threat levels change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5e2879b2cdb0ca2b17cdcfc556523218.poster.avif?t=1785535994\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5e2879b2cdb0ca2b17cdcfc556523218.webm?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5e2879b2cdb0ca2b17cdcfc556523218.mp4?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The System Pushes Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic builds. Resources run thin. Regulations shift. Criminals adapt. Every solution creates a new bottleneck.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Checkpoint 19 is a border control management game where speed keeps traffic moving, but every shortcut increases the chance of letting criminals through.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage a growing checkpoint facility. Inspect vehicles, assign officers, expand lanes, control traffic flow, and decide how much risk you are willing to accept.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Decision Trades Speed for Security</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process vehicles quickly and queues stay under control.<br>Inspect too lightly and contraband slips through.<br>Inspect too strictly and traffic turns into gridlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is not to eliminate risk.<br>Your job is to survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5de3c9617e705d7bb64d6c6e3f60fb11.poster.avif?t=1785535994\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5de3c9617e705d7bb64d6c6e3f60fb11.webm?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5de3c9617e705d7bb64d6c6e3f60fb11.mp4?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Officers Under Pressure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire officers with different strengths. Assign them to checkpoints, secondary inspections, and support roles. But staff are not machines. Fatigue, workload, and poor assignments increase mistakes when the pressure rises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/aff45920c4eb9d6f4a8f55f42d5b681c.poster.avif?t=1785535994\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/aff45920c4eb9d6f4a8f55f42d5b681c.webm?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/aff45920c4eb9d6f4a8f55f42d5b681c.mp4?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Checkpoint That Can Survive Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand roads, inspection lanes, surveillance zones, holding areas, and logistics routes. A layout that works during calm traffic may collapse when volume increases or threat levels change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5e2879b2cdb0ca2b17cdcfc556523218.poster.avif?t=1785535994\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5e2879b2cdb0ca2b17cdcfc556523218.webm?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/extras/5e2879b2cdb0ca2b17cdcfc556523218.mp4?t=1785535994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The System Pushes Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic builds. Resources run thin. Regulations shift. Criminals adapt. Every solution creates a new bottleneck.</p>", "short_description": "Run a border checkpoint where every second saved can let a criminal through. Build lanes, manage tired officers, inspect vehicles, and keep traffic moving before your checkpoint collapses into chaos.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/94157a4bb495a09832c8644887f7a59a55d9bb49/header.jpg?t=1785535994", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426690/943837cd3ab828257e89ad7e7346012baecc3f52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785535994", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati